          <li><a href="#why-was-the-global-vehicle">Why was the global vehicle sales forecast cut?</a></li>
          <li><a href="#how-does-a-hybrid-weighted">How does a hybrid-weighted mix change automotive electronics content?</a></li>
          <li><a href="#watching">What we're watching</a></li>
